":"正在做、持续进行（-고 계시다，尊敬表达）","pronunciation":["계ː시다","게ː시다"]},{"id":"6fcdfa8c124ab5cb","term":"잠시","zh":"片刻，暂时","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3","entryId":"71203","definition":"一小会儿。","pronunciation":["잠ː시"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/56015a15af0c81f6ef99.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.837,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62597","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":33,"sequenceScore":1.4904,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["在的。不过他正在睡觉，请您稍等一会儿。","智秀，你的嘴唇怎么这么发紫啊？","爷爷在吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["在的。不过他正在睡觉，请您稍等一会儿。","爷爷在吗？","智秀，你的嘴唇怎么这么发紫啊？"],"answer":0}]}
